{"4098490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Motocon", "steam_appid": 4098490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098490/extras/fbad0ebaffe29910b137f66eec82a199.avif?t=1773842408\" width=1560 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOTOCON</strong> is a fast-paced moto combat game set in a hyper-commercialized cyberpunk future. Battle your friends with head-on collisions plus a variety of gadgets. Fight over the highest stack of cash and sponsorships to take your game to the next level! Playable solo, split-screen couch co-op, or online with up to 8 players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer (8 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable robot motorcycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicular combat and destruction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MOTOCON is still a work in progress - details and store descriptions are subject to change.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098490/extras/fbad0ebaffe29910b137f66eec82a199.avif?t=1773842408\" width=1560 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOTOCON</strong> is a fast-paced moto combat game set in a hyper-commercialized cyberpunk future. Battle your friends with head-on collisions plus a variety of gadgets. Fight over the highest stack of cash and sponsorships to take your game to the next level! Playable solo, split-screen couch co-op, or online with up to 8 players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature